# Diagnostics per fixture. 'server' = target/release/tcl-lsp-server (built 2026-11-22) over JSON-RPC, default dialect,
# publishDiagnostics (includes the source-style pass W111/W112/W115/W118). 'mcp' = mcp__tcl-lsp__analyze (cached build),
# which omits the source-style pass. Format: fixture <TAB> source <TAB> code@line ...
