c03-switch-body-comment-odd.tcl	mcp tcl9.0	-   (tclsh: 'extra switch pattern with no body' on every release: FALSE NEGATIVE)
c07-comment-backslash-continuation.tcl	mcp tcl9.0	-   (server gives W115)
c18-expr-continuation-and-comment.tcl	mcp tcl8.6	-   ('#' in expr is an error before 9.0: FALSE NEGATIVE)
switch/array set/foreach data lists with '#' lines	mcp tcl9.0	-   (no lint that the '#' line is data, not a comment)
c25-docstring-continuation.tcl	mcp tcl9.0	-   ; hover on add1 shows the doc 'Adds one. \\ proc hidden {} {}' (the swallowed line is shown as doc text)
c27-comment-even-backslashes.tcl	note	W115 is FALSE: an even backslash run does not continue the comment (all engines print 'shown')
c11/c20	note	W123 suggests "did you mean '!'?" for 'y', 'b', 'd'
c16-quote-brace-in-body.tcl	note	E200 says 'missing close-bracket'; tclsh says 'missing close-brace'
